WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.000
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:17.452 --> 00:00:22.500
They want to paint us in neon light

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:28.200
They want to tell us how to burn tonight

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.600
But you and me, we know the truth

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:33.199
They can't buy what we built in our youth

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:40.200
Turn off the synths, unplug the drum

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:45.200
Look at the monsters that we have become

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:49.800
Let's strip it down to the wood and wire

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:53.800
And build ourselves a signal fire

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:58.200
Just the piano and the six-string strum

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:02.000
Before the noise and the kingdom come

00:01:02.147 --> 00:01:06.200
No one to tell us how the story ends

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:11.000
Just a brother and a sister and the time we spend

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:14.000
On our own frequency

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:17.500
Just you and me

00:01:25.303 --> 00:01:29.800
They tried to sell a manufactured dream

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:35.000
A perfect picture on a glowing screen

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:38.200
But all I need is sitting right here

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:41.500
The melody is finally clear

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:46.800
Just the piano and the six-string strum

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:52.200
Before the noise and the kingdom come

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:57.000
No one to tell us how the story ends

00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:02.000
Just a brother and a sister and the time we spend

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:04.500
On our own frequency

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:07.500
Just you and me

00:02:08.672 --> 00:02:11.800
No heavy gloss...

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:16.500
No studio boss...

00:02:17.929 --> 00:02:26.500
Just the music we wanted to make!

00:02:26.957 --> 00:02:31.900
Just the piano and the six-string strum

00:02:32.082 --> 00:02:36.800
Before the noise and the kingdom come

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:41.500
No one to tell us how the story ends

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:46.500
Just a brother and a sister and the time we spend

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:49.500
On our own frequency

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:53.000
Just you and me

00:02:54.151 --> 00:02:58.500
Our own frequency...

00:03:00.176 --> 00:03:05.000
Just you and me...

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:24.000
[Outro]
